### Issue keys in messages.

## What is wrong with the template a branch for an issue is named by,
## for whoever is typing it.

# The most bytes the template can have.
issue-keys-template-too-long = The name's template is longer than { $most } bytes.
issue-keys-template-control = The name's template cannot contain control characters.
issue-keys-no-name = The template makes no name.
